+
+/** Stateful Double Ratchet isolated from legacy Signal records.
+ * Calls are synchronized per object. Failed authentication/parsing leaves the
+ * state unchanged. After a successful operation persist serializedData before
+ * releasing an outgoing message or accepting an incoming message in the app.
+ * Caller must serialize storage updates across separate restored objects. */
